WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.750
Any provider

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:05.250
any model

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:08.917
Just say what you want done

00:00:08.917 --> 00:00:11.617
Steve sees it the moment it starts

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:15.933
Opus gets to work

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:24.633
and shows a live preview

00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:30.817
Steve checks the design from his phone

00:00:30.817 --> 00:00:33.217
and answers in the same task

00:00:33.217 --> 00:00:36.467
Happy. Work together.
